{"id":"db63019bd413a908","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md","title":"KF中正层真理迭代的幂等性","display":"thm-truth-iteration-stability — KF中正层真理迭代的幂等性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-iteration-stability","aliases":["91-thm-truth-iteration-stability","91-thm-iteration-stability"],"display":"thm-truth-iteration-stability — KF中正层真理迭代的幂等性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","[[91-df-KF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-iteration-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-iteration-stability</span><span>91-thm-iteration-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-iteration-stability — KF中正层真理迭代的幂等性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-truth-iteration-stability-—-KF-中正层真理迭代的幂等性\">thm-truth-iteration-stability — KF 中正层真理迭代的幂等性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (含真理原子组合条款的标准 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\\varphi=\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\">\\(T^n\\varphi=\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\)</span>\n(真理迭代, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (真理语言句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\forall n\\geq1\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\nT^{n+1}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T^n\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\forall n\\geq1\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\nT^{n+1}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T^n\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因而所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\\varphi\">\\(T^n\\varphi\\)</span> 在 KF 中彼此等价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基本步是 KF 对真理原子的组合条款</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 作外部归纳即可。</p>\n<p>幂等性从第一层开始，不能把右侧换成原句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。全自指透明式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\)</span> 对说谎者会导致\n矛盾。句子在不同固定点是否稳定也是另一概念，不是上述句法嵌套等价的\n前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-truth-iteration-stability-—-KF-中正层真理迭代的幂等性","text":"thm-truth-iteration-stability — KF 中正层真理迭代的幂等性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T^n\\varphi=\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)$\n(真理迭代, see [[91-df-truth-iteration]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n\\varphi=\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\forall n\\geq1\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\nT^{n+1}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T^n\\varphi\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"T^n\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1447,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1